  "metadata_synthesis": "Movie. 2012. Grand superhero finale. Apocalyptic urban epic.",
  "setting_and_subculture": "Besieged winter metropolis. Mercenary-occupied streets. Bleak, mythic underground prisons. Panic-stricken stock exchanges. Snow-covered kangaroo courts. High-society balls.",
  "visual_tone_and_feel": "Massive IMAX scale. Cold grays and stark winter whites. Bleak, naturalistic lighting. Sweeping aerial shots. Ground-level urban warfare. Somber, grounded realism.",
  "media_era_tone": "Early 2010s post-recession cinema. Prestige, auteur-driven blockbuster. Operatic and ambitious scale. Thunderous, bass-heavy Zimmer score.",
  "pacing_and_structure": "Slow, mournful prologue. Escalating systemic terror. Catastrophic midpoint physical defeat. Long, grueling period of exile and recovery. Explosive, race-against-the-clock climax.",
  "atmosphere_and_mood": "Apocalyptic. Mournful. Desperate. Unrelentingly tense. Triumphant yet deeply exhausting. Heavy with the weight of legacy and consequence.",
  "themes_and_messages": "Class warfare and populist rage. The pain of moving on. Overcoming absolute physical and spiritual brokenness. Fear as a primal tool for survival. Rebirth through suffering.",
  "character_relationships": "Weary, broken billionaire and his fiercely loyal, heartbroken butler. Hobbled hero and pragmatic, cynical thief. Unstoppable physical juggernaut shattering the protagonist. Idealistic young cop desperate for a symbol.",
